<title>RUSSIA: Russia launches military satellite.</title>
<headline>Russia launches military satellite.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Russian Proton-K heavy booster successfully sent a defence ministry satellite into orbit on Friday, Russian news agencies reported.</p>
<p>The Kosmos series satellite was launched at Baikonur cosmodrome in Kazakhstan at 1657 GMT, Itar-Tass news agency said.</p>
